Barbie and the Magic of Pegasus is a 2005 animated fantasy adventure film directed by Greg Richardson (in his
feature directorial debut) and produced by Mattel Entertainment with Mainframe Entertainment.

10
00:53:07,500 --> 00:53:13,500
It first premiered on Nickelodeon on September 18, 2005, and it was
released later to VHS/DVD on September 20, 2005.

11
00:58:26,250 --> 00:58:32,250
The sixth entry in the Barbie film series, it is the second to feature an original story and the first
not to be based on previous material, as well as the only film to be released in 3D.

12
01:03:45,000 --> 01:03:51,000
It follows the story of Princess Annika, who has to save her parents
after an evil wizard named Wenlock turns them to stone.

13
